    "name": "Asteros",
    "steam_appid": 2991430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/0a47802ac9fe60945c83f4bff2e97ebc.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a harrowing mission to eliminate an unknown threat in a research facility on the planet of Asteros with your ultimate goal being to establish a new home for human civilization. However, something goes terribly wrong - you die, only to wake up in your pod again, reliving the mission with a disturbing sense of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu. As you navigate through this nightmare, you slowly unravel the truth behind your reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/fb83eb48a4f604ea65ccaff7e7eb19cb.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=299 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Melee and Gunplay</i>: Engage in fluid combat with a mix of melee and ranged attacks. Combine these techniques to create unique combat sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/4e7b583d5d5bc4754204f8e0522814fe.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/4e7b583d5d5bc4754204f8e0522814fe.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/4e7b583d5d5bc4754204f8e0522814fe.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/e8bedd95476b36f2e0b15bf9da01b800.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/e8bedd95476b36f2e0b15bf9da01b800.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/e8bedd95476b36f2e0b15bf9da01b800.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Combo Chains</i>: Build momentum by chaining together attacks with precision and timing to unleash devastating and dynamic combos. Mastering these sequences enhances your combat flow, offering a satisfying and impactful fighting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/047e00bb34fe2a39d9acefa71906ba2d.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/047e00bb34fe2a39d9acefa71906ba2d.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/047e00bb34fe2a39d9acefa71906ba2d.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/0dc96c4b44f4398ae056c7977012bed1.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=299 /></span><strong>  </strong><i>Challenging Boss Encounters</i>: Face off against powerful bosses in intense battles that test your skills and adaptability. Each encounter takes place in unique arenas, presenting new challenges and opportunities to overcome. Defeating these formidable foes rewards you with relics that provide permanent upgrades, giving you the edge you need for deeper runs. Every victory is a step closer to uncovering the secrets of Asteros.    <br>   <br><i>Permanent Progression</i>: Death is not the end. Discover and collect powerful Artifacts during your runs that persist across attempts, granting new ways to enhance your playstyle and approach challenges. These permanent treasures ensure that every failure brings you closer to ultimate success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/cf67898d14d3a571876c89ee5db48cc3.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/cf67898d14d3a571876c89ee5db48cc3.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/cf67898d14d3a571876c89ee5db48cc3.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rogue-like adventure where every death is a step closer to unraveling the mystery. Will you conquer the horrors of Asteros and save humanity or become another lost soul in the void? The answers lie within the depths of the research facility.    <br>  <br>Built with the cutting-edge technology of Unreal Engine 5, this game delivers stunning visuals and immersive gameplay that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/0a47802ac9fe60945c83f4bff2e97ebc.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a harrowing mission to eliminate an unknown threat in a research facility on the planet of Asteros with your ultimate goal being to establish a new home for human civilization. However, something goes terribly wrong - you die, only to wake up in your pod again, reliving the mission with a disturbing sense of d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu. As you navigate through this nightmare, you slowly unravel the truth behind your reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/fb83eb48a4f604ea65ccaff7e7eb19cb.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=299 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Melee and Gunplay</i>: Engage in fluid combat with a mix of melee and ranged attacks. Combine these techniques to create unique combat sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/4e7b583d5d5bc4754204f8e0522814fe.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/4e7b583d5d5bc4754204f8e0522814fe.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/4e7b583d5d5bc4754204f8e0522814fe.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/e8bedd95476b36f2e0b15bf9da01b800.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/e8bedd95476b36f2e0b15bf9da01b800.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/e8bedd95476b36f2e0b15bf9da01b800.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Combo Chains</i>: Build momentum by chaining together attacks with precision and timing to unleash devastating and dynamic combos. Mastering these sequences enhances your combat flow, offering a satisfying and impactful fighting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/047e00bb34fe2a39d9acefa71906ba2d.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/047e00bb34fe2a39d9acefa71906ba2d.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/047e00bb34fe2a39d9acefa71906ba2d.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/0dc96c4b44f4398ae056c7977012bed1.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=299 /></span><strong>  </strong><i>Challenging Boss Encounters</i>: Face off against powerful bosses in intense battles that test your skills and adaptability. Each encounter takes place in unique arenas, presenting new challenges and opportunities to overcome. Defeating these formidable foes rewards you with relics that provide permanent upgrades, giving you the edge you need for deeper runs. Every victory is a step closer to uncovering the secrets of Asteros.    <br>   <br><i>Permanent Progression</i>: Death is not the end. Discover and collect powerful Artifacts during your runs that persist across attempts, granting new ways to enhance your playstyle and approach challenges. These permanent treasures ensure that every failure brings you closer to ultimate success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/cf67898d14d3a571876c89ee5db48cc3.poster.avif?t=1740438561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/cf67898d14d3a571876c89ee5db48cc3.webm?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991430/extras/cf67898d14d3a571876c89ee5db48cc3.mp4?t=1740438561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rogue-like adventure where every death is a step closer to unraveling the mystery. Will you conquer the horrors of Asteros and save humanity or become another lost soul in the void? The answers lie within the depths of the research facility.    <br>  <br>Built with the cutting-edge technology of Unreal Engine 5, this game delivers stunning visuals and immersive gameplay that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p>",
